---
title: "publishSaleResults (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard1: onlyLegion
    q_guard1 --> q_guard2: whenNotPaused
    q_guard2 --> q_guard3: whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard3 --> q_guard4: whenRefundPeriodIsOver
    q_guard4 --> q_setClaimRoot: s_claimMerkleRoot = claimMerkleRoot
    q_setClaimRoot --> q_setAcceptedRoot: s_acceptedMerkleRoot = acceptedMerkleRoot
    q_setAcceptedRoot --> q_calcCapital: totalCapitalRaised = tokensAllocated * tokenPrice / 10^askTokenDecimals
    q_calcCapital --> q_setAllocated: s_tokensAllocated = tokensAllocated
    q_setAllocated --> q_emit: emit SaleResultsPublished(claimMerkleRoot, acceptedMerkleRoot, tokensAllocated)
    q_emit --> [*]: return

    note right of q_guard4
        INV-001: Results can only be published after refund period
        INV-002: Only Legion admin can publish results
    end note

    note right of q_calcCapital
        INV-003: totalCapitalRaised = tokensAllocated * tokenPrice / 10^askTokenDecimals
        INV-004: Merkle roots enable off-chain claim verification
    end note
